          ("Clonal smooth-muscle proliferation within the uterine wall", "Leiomyomas can impair fertility, but histology would show smooth muscle rather than extrauterine endometrial glands and stroma."),
          ("Diffuse invasion of endometrial glands into the myometrium", "Adenomyosis causes painful, often heavy menses and a diffusely enlarged uterus; it does not explain the peritoneal implants and uterosacral nodularity."),
